<title>USA: UCAR to buy back up to $100 mln of stock.</title>
<headline>UCAR to buy back up to $100 mln of stock.</headline>
<dateline>DANBURY, Conn. 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>UCAR International Inc said Thursday it had authorized the re-purchase of up to $100 million of its common shares.</p>
<p>Shares will be purchased at prevailing prices from time to time in the open market, the company said.</p>
<p>No minimum or maximum time period or number of shares has been established, it said.</p>
<p>The company's stock was up 3/4 at 41-7/8 in mid-afternoon trading.</p>
</text>
